<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Hi&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal">I wanted to reach out to you today, as a valued member of the Black
community, My name is <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;NAME&gt;</span>
and I am an American Red Cross Account Manager. <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">African American blood donors play a critical role in
helping patients battling sickle cell disease to receive the most compatible
blood match. Today, there aren’t enough African American donors to meet this
urgent need.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Answer the call to help save those suffering from
diseases, such as sickle cell, by partnering with the Red Cross to host a blood
drive and collect the most compatible blood for to help support over 100,000
sickle cell patients and families.</b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Our Blood Saves Lives!</b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Let’s find time to talk. Please call me at </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">&lt;XXX_XXX_XXXX&gt;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> or
email me at </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">&lt;email
address&gt;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> so I can introduce myself and talk about a blood drive at
your organization.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal">









</p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<br>]]></td>
</tr>
